ap[Key]Value{}\n  for _, v := range vs {\n    m[v.Key] = v.Value\n  }\n  return m\n}```","ts":"1615373898.438500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jwj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc0e2ada-8119-4cf6-9bb0-1e821dfc52e0","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"mapで同じように手抜きしようと思ったけど無理かも","ts":"1615373427.436800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gYk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77f400fe-e082-4472-b05e-cc5fec125cf2","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"逆にこれでGoがなんで `[]型名{初期化}` させてるかのお気持ちが分かった気がする。","ts":"1615373031.436400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0JYaN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10a9874f-f1f6-4e45-b9de-b802a55b423c","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ですね（そしてtoSliceの意味が消える）","ts":"1615372966.435800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x9n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a2191a7-8170-4178-9b7b-f4d454549c37","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"`toSlice[float64](1, 2.2)` すれば動くやつ。","ts":"1615372941.435600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m2I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e84b680-125e-47a8-9c93-f4241c6f2f7a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど","ts":"1615372860.435200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C0j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a4d15a32-2c12-43e0-8203-b35be9aa44f6","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"とりあえずgo2goでは先頭の型を見るのか","ts":"1615372793.434900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rOD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d7d5e54-5b6b-4141-89c7-7440254a4a19","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"`fmt.Printf(\"%T\\n\", toSlice(1, 2.2))`\n\n`